  "question": {
    "text": "A sphere is rotating between two rough inclined walls as shown in figure. Coefficient of friction between each wall and the sphere is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> be the frictional forces at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0030348_Question.jpg\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 136px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "jfTQC",
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math>",
      "image": null,
